  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Providing education to conflict affected population in north east Nigeria. IRC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Providing education to conflict affected population in north east Nigeria. IRC is a component of North East Nigeria Transition to Development Programme reported by FCDO with a funding type of 111 - Not for profit organisation and a budget of &#xa3;7,692,927. It works in the following sector(s): Immediate post-emergency reconstruction and rehabilitation, Civilian peace-building, conflict prevention and resolution, Disaster prevention and preparedness.</narrative>
  </description>
